hadiths[97]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main hazar aur safar mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath raha. Aap hazar mein jab zuhr ki namaz parhte to char rak'at (farz) aur un ke ba'd do rak'at parhte; aur jab asr ki namaz parhte to (sirf) char rak'at (farz hi) parhte aur un ke ba'd koi namaz na parhte; aur jab maghrib ki namaz parhte to teen rak'at (farz) parhte aur un ke ba'd do rak'at parhte; aur jab isha ki namaz ada karte to char rak'at farz ada karte aur un ke ba'd do rak'at parhte the. Aur main safar mein aap ke sath raha to aap jab zuhr ki namaz parhte to do rak'at (farz) parhte aur un ke ba'd (bhi) do rak'at parhte the; aur jab asr ki namaz parhte to (sirf) do rak'at parhte, un ke ba'd koi namaz na parhte; aur jab maghrib ki namaz parhte to teen rak'at (farz) parhte aur un ke ba'd do rak'at parhte the aur farmaya: “Ye (namaz maghrib) din ke witr hain jin ke sath din khatm ho jata hai aur raat ka aghaz hota hai.” Aur jab isha ki namaz parhte to do rak'at parhte aur un ke ba'd (bhi) do rak'at parhte the."
"2","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se junubi ke muta'alliq pucha jo sona chahta hai to aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Wo namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu kare (aur so jaye).” Aur Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) jab (halat janabat mein) khana khana chahte to wuzu kar lete the."
"3","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hazar aur safar mein namaz parhi to maine aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hazar mein zuhr ki namaz char rak'at (farz) aur us ke ba'd do rak'at ada kein; aur asr ki namaz ki char rak'at (farz) ada kein, us ke ba'd kuch nahin parha; aur maghrib ki namaz teen rak'at (farz) aur un ke ba'd do rak'at parhein; aur isha ki namaz char rak'at (farz) aur us ke ba'd do rak'at ada ki. Aur maine aap ke sath safar mein zuhr ki namaz do rak'at (farz) aur us ke ba'd do rak'at ada ki; aur asr ki namaz (sirf) do rak'at ada ki aur un ke ba'd kuch na parha; aur maghrib ki namaz teen rak'at (farz) aur us ke ba'd do rak'at (farz) parhi; aur ye namaz din ki witr (namaz) hai. Safar aur hazar mein is mein kami nahin hoti; aur isha ki namaz do rak'at (farz) aur us ke ba'd do rak'at parhi."
"4","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jis ne kutta pala — shikar ke kutte ya janwaron ki rakhwali ke ya dushman ko darane wale kutte ke ilawa — to rozana us ke (nek) amal se do qirat kam ho jate hain.” (Abdullah bin Umar se) sawal hua: Abu Abdur Rahman! Hum to ek qirat sunte hain. To unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe us zat ki qasam! Jis ke siwa koi ibadat ke laiq nahin, mere kaanon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna: Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do qirat keh rahe the. Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila kehte hain: Maine ye baat Nafi' (Rahimahullah) se zikr ki to unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko ye hadith bayan karte hue suna, lekin maine “darane wale kutte” ke alfaz un se nahin sune."
"5","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se raat ki namaz ke muta'alliq pucha to aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Do do rak'at hai; aur agar subah (ke tulu' hone) ka khadsha ho to ek rak'at parh le.”"
"6","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Juraij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ubaid mere baap ke paas aaye aur kaha: Main Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas hazir hua aur un se kuchh kaamon ke muta'alliq pucha to unhon ne kaha: Bayan karein, aap hamesha mere paas kisi maqsad se hi aaye hain. Maine puchha: Maine aap ko rukn yamani aur hajar aswad ke ilawa kisi aur rukn ko chhute nahin dekha. To unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yahi karte dekha hai. Maine kaha: Maine aap ko sirf sabti jute hi pehne dekha hai. Asim ne kaha: Sabti jute se murad wo juta hai jo chamre ko saaf karne aur rangne ke ba'd, jis mein baal na hon, tayyar ho. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is tarah karte (sabti jute pehne) dekha. Aap us mein wuzu karte aur us mein namaz ada karte aur us ko pasand farmate the."
"7","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan khare hue aur farmaya: “Phal ko na becho jab tak us ki salahiyat (pukhtagi) zahir na ho jaye.”"
"8","[AI-translation] Taus (Rahimahullah) ne Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se muta'alliq bayan kiya: (Un se sawal hua) Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mitti ke ghare aur kaddu ke bartan (mein nabiz banane) se mana kiya? To unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"9","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas betha hua tha ke aap ke paas ek naujawan aaya aur us ne arz kiya: Ae Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Kya main aap ke qareeb ho jaun? To aap ne farmaya: “Qareeb ho jao.” Wo (itna) qareeb hua ke us ne apni raan aap ki raan par rakh di aur arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Islam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tu gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin, wo akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahin; aur Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us ke Rasul hain. Us (naujawan) ne puchha: Jab main ye kaam karun to main musalman hun? Aap ne farmaya: “Haan (tu musalman hai).” Us ne puchha: Iman kya hai? To aap ne farmaya: “Tu achhi aur buri taqdeer par iman laye; tu jannat aur jahannam par iman laye; marne ke ba'd dobara ji uthne par iman laye; aur mizan (ke barhaq hone) par iman laye.” Us ne arz kiya: Jab main ye kaam karun to main momin hun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"10","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamein namaz mein tashahhud sikhate the jaise likhna sikhane wala ustad bachon ko sikhata hai."
"11","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Oont ke gosht (khane) ke ba'd wuzu karo, aur bakri ke gosht (khane) ke ba'd wuzu na karo. Oontni ke dudh (peene) ke ba'd wuzu karo, aur bakri ke dudh (peene) ke ba'd wuzu na karo. Bakrion ke baaron mein namaz parho, aur oonton ke bethne ki jaghon mein namaz na parho.”"
"12","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Beshak aasman wale zameen walon se azan ke siwa kuchh nahin sunte.”"
"13","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyamat ke din muazzin logon mein gardan sab se lambe honge, aur wo sab se pehle kapre pehnaye jayenge."
"14","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Sab halal cheezon mein Allah ke nazdeek sab se napasandida talaq hai.”"
"15","[AI-translation] Abu Umayyah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kasir bin Ubaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Makhlad ne ham se Mu'arrif bin Wasil se, unhon ne Muharib bin Disar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se bayan kiya, aur unhon ne Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichhli hadith jaisi riwayat bayan ki."
"16","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Allah ne unhein 'Abrar' (nek log) naam diya, kyunki unhon ne maan baap aur aulad ke sath neki ki. Jaise tumhare walidain ka tum par haq hai, waise hi tumhari aulad ka bhi tum par haq hai.”"
"17","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zuban rukne tak (lagatar) namaz aur ghulamon (ki dekhbhal) ki wasiyyat karte rahe."
"18","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se puchha gaya: Aap do ruknon par (bahut) bheer karte hain, halanki hum ne kisi aur ko aap ki tarah karte nahin dekha. Unhon ne farmaya: Agar main karta hun to is liye ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Beshak in donon ko chhuna gunahon ko mita deta hai.”"
"19","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Beshak chughli jhut hai, aur keena aur (qabaili aur jahili) josh jahannam mein hain; ye donon musalman ke seene mein jama nahin ho sakte.”"
"20","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nauha karne wali, (nauha) sunne wali, (matam mein) sir mundane wali, cheekh-chilla kar rone wali, godne wali aur gudwane wali aurat par la'nat ki, aur farmaya: Janazon ke pichhe jane mein auraton ke liye koi sawab nahin."
"21","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Chughli, gali-galoch aur (jahili) josh jahannam (mein le jayenge), aur ye donon momin ke seene mein jama nahin ho sakte.”"
"22","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum par aisa waqt tha jab har shakhs apne musalman bhai ko dinar-dirham ke muamle mein khud se zyada haqdar samajhta tha; aur aaj dinar-dirham hamein musalman bhai se zyada mehboob hain. Aur is ki wajah ye hai ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Jab log dinar-dirham mein bukhl karenge, bailon ki dumein pakrenge, Allah ki rah mein jihad chhor denge aur dhoke se len-den karenge, to Allah Ta'ala un par zillat nazil karega, aur wo deen ki taraf na lautein jab tak wo un se na uthegi.”"
"23","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ko jab bhi jagte, miswak karte the."
"24","[AI-translation] Aur Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Meri ye ummat sattar ummaton ki takmeel hai; hum un mein sab se aakhiri aur sab se behtar hain.”"
"25","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo azan de, iqamat kehne ka wahi zyada haqdar hai."
"26","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Mihraz kehte hain: Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Allah ke ghar ka tawaf kar rahe the ke ek aadmi un se mila aur kaha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko (Allah se) sargoshi ke tareeqe ke baare mein kya farmate suna? Unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Qiyamat ke din momin ko us ke Rab ke qareeb laya jayega, jaise wo ek memna ho; wo us par apna parda rakhega aur us se puchega: Kya tu janta hai? Kya tu janta hai? Aur wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Janta hun, ae mere Rab! Janta hun. Phir puchega: Kya tu janta hai? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Janta hun. Phir puchega: Kya tu janta hai? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Janta hun. Phir Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Maine duniya mein tere liye ise chhupaya tha, aaj tujhe muaf karta hun. Phir use us ki nekion ka sahifa diya jayega.” Aur kafiron aur munafiqon ke baare mein sab logon ke samne pukara jayega: Yahi wo hain jinhon ne apne Rab par jhut bola; khabardar, zalimon par Allah ki la'nat. Qatada (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Us din aisa koi ruswa na kiya jayega jis ki ruswai makhluq se chhupi rahi."
"27","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ashtar kehte hain: Allah ki qasam! Main Abdullah bin Muti' ke paas tha jab unhon ne Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Yazid bin Muawiya par hamla kiya tha. Us waqt Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) un ke paas aaye. Unhon ne ek takiya manga, wo unhein pesh kiya gaya, lekin unhon ne kaha: Main tumhare paas bethne nahin aaya, balki main tumhein wo hadith sunana chahta tha jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni. Main gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Jo ita'at (hakim) se hath kheench le, qiyamat ke din Allah se aise haal mein milega ke us (najat ke) liye koi daleel na hogi; aur jo aise haal mein mare ke us ki gardan mein bai'at na ho, wo jahiliyyat ki maut mara.” Phir (Abdullah bin Umar) wapas chale gaye."
"28","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne fitne ka zikr kiya, aur munh dhake ek aadmi wahan se guzra. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne (us ke baare mein) farmaya: “Ye mazlum qatl kiya jayega.” Maine use dekha, to wo Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) the."
"29","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nabti qabilon ke darmiyan un ke shehron mein na raho. Wo guftagu mein tum se jhagrein to un se bacho. Un se bacho, un se bacho; aur Khuzistan ke logon se nikah na karo, kyunki un ki jadon mein bewafai hai."
"30","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar ke azad karda ghulam Yasar bin Numair kehte hain: Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne mujhe fajr ke ba'd ye namaz parhte dekha aur puchha: Ae Yasar! Kitni rak'at parhein? Maine kaha: Nahin janta. Unhon ne kaha: Tu janta hi nahin. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laye, hum ye namaz parh rahe the. Aap hum par naraz hue aur farmaya: “Tumhare hazir ghaib tak pahunchayein. Beshak fajr ke tulu' ke ba'd do rak'at (fajr ki sunnat) ke siwa koi (nafl) namaz nahin.”"
"31","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jume ke din roze ke baghair kabhi nahin dekha."
"32","[AI-translation] Ja'far kehte hain: Main Abdullah bin Umar aur Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas betha tha ke un mein se ek ne dusre se kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Qiyamat ke din aadam ki aulad paseena bahayegi.” Un mein se ek ne kaha: Kaan ki lau tak, aur dusre ne kaha: Lagaam ki tarah munh tak pahunchega."
"33","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se puchha: Ihram wala janwaron mein se kya maar sakta hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: “Wo kauwa, cheel, chuha, kaatne wala kutta aur bichhu maar sakta hai.” Ayyub kehte hain: Maine Nafi' (Rahimahullah) se saanpon ke baare mein puchha; unhon ne kaha: In ke maarne mein koi ikhtilaf nahin."
"34","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jo zar-pashi ke ba'd khajur ka darakht beche, us ka (chalu saal ka) phal bechne wale ka hai; magar kharidar shart lagaye (to us ka).”"
"35","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen dirham qeemat ki dhal ki chori par (chor ka) hath kata."
"36","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabana ki be' se mana kiya, wo ye hai: Aadmi apni zameen ki paidawar malum wazan ke badle beche, shart par ke paidawar zyada ho to use kuchh zyada na milega, aur wazan se kam ho to nuqsan ka zimmedar hoga. Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne darakht par khajur (andaze ke mutabiq sukhi ya taza khajur ke badle) araya ki be' ki ijazat di."
"37","[AI-translation] Nafi' (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne khwab dekha, jaise un ke hath mein resham ka tukra ho, aur jannat mein jahan bhi jana chahein, wo unhein ura kar wahan le jaye. Unhon ne ye khwab Ummul Mominin Hafsa (Raziyallahu anha) ko sunaya; Hafsa (Raziyallahu anha) ne use Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sunaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Beshak Abdullah ek nek aadmi hai.”"
"38","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghulam jab apne Rab ki ibadat khub anjam de aur aaqa ki ita'at kare, use dohra sawab diya jata hai."
"39","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko use chhute dekhne ke ba'd kisi haal mein bhi kaale pathar ko chhuna nahin chhora."
"40","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi jume (ki namaz) ke liye jaye, ghusl kare."
"41","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jo jaan-bujh kar kisi momin ko qatl kare, us ne yaqeenan Allah ka inkar kiya.”"
"42","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Har nasha lane wali cheez khamr (sharab) hai.”"
"43","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ifrad hajj ka ihram bandha."
"44","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Beshak aadmi namaz, zakat, hajj, umra, roza aur jihad walon mein se ho sakta hai; yahan tak ke bhalai ke bahut se kaam ginaye; aur qiyamat ke din use sirf apni niyyat ke mutabiq badla milega.”"
"45","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Musalman shakhs par (hakim ke) hukm ko sunna aur manna wajib hai, chahe pasand ho ya napasand.”"
"46","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Subah se pehle witr parho.”"
"47","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se puchha: “Ihram wala kya kapre pehen sakta hai?” Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: “Ihram wala qamees, pagri, pajama, topi ya chamre ke moze na pehne. Jute na milein to chamre ke moze pehen sakta hai, lekin takhnon se neeche kaat le. Aur koi kapra na pehne jise wars ya za'fran (khushbu) laga ho.” Ibn Aun ne pagri ka zikr nahin kiya."
"48","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein Madina ke aas-paas kutton ko maarne ka hukm diya. Hum dehat se aane wali aurat ke kutte ko bhi maarne lage."
"49","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Tum mein se koi malik ki ijazat ke baghair kisi ke janwar ko na dohe. Kya tum mein se koi pasand karta hai ke us ke khazane mein aakar tora jaye aur andar ka sab nikal liya jaye? Beshak janwaron ke than un ke malikon ke khazane hain.”"
"50","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Ihram wala na (khud) nikah kare, na (kisi aur ka) nikah karaye.”"
"51","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Chaubis oonton mein pachis hone tak paanch bakriyan (zakat) hain; pachis par pahunchein to un mein ek 'binte makhaz' (ek sala oontni); 'binte makhaz' na ho to paintees tak ek 'ibne labun' (do sala oont). Phir zakat ke oonton ki umr ke baare mein waisi hi surat bayan ki jaisi dusre bayan karte hain, ek sau bees tak pahunchne tak. Barh jayein to har paintalis mein ek 'ibne labun', har saath mein ek 'hiqqah' (zakat ke taur par).”"
"52","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya: Har chalis bakrion mein ek sau bees tak ek bakri zakat; barhein to do sau tak do; aur barhein to teen sau tak teen; is se zyada barhein to har sau mein ek bakri zakat. (Zakat ke dar se) jure rewar ko alag na karo, alag rewaron ko na joro; har do shareek barabar hisab chukayein; aur zakat wasulne wale ko burha, nar ya aibdar (janwar) na diya jaye; magar zakat dene wala chahe (to de)."
"53","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichhli hadith jaisi riwayat bayan ki."
"54","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Har nasha lane wali cheez sharab hai, aur har nasha lane wali cheez haram hai.”"
"55","[AI-translation] Nafi' (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se ashura ke roze ke baare mein puchha gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Jahiliyyat ke log is din ki ta'zeem karte the."
"56","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jis musalman ke paas wasiyyat karne ko kuchh ho, us ke liye ye munasib nahin ke do raatein baghair paas likhi wasiyyat rakhe guzare.”"
"57","[AI-translation] Nafi' (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai: Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) safar mein sard ya barish ki raat mein isha ki azan dete to kehte: “Apne thikanon mein namaz parho.” Beshak maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sard aur barish ki raat mein aisa hi karte dekha."
"58","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke maine Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Jo ita'at (hakim) se hath kheench le, wo Allah se aise haal mein milega ke us ke paas koi daleel na hogi; aur jo aise haal mein mare ke us ki gardan mein bai'at na ho, wo jahiliyyat ki maut mara.”"
"59","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek yahudi mard aur yahudi aurat ko rajm kiya."
"60","[AI-translation] Nafi' (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) safar mein sawari par maghrib-isha jama karte the aur kehte the: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kisi kaam mein jaldi hoti to in donon ko jama karte the."
"61","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Jo asr chhor de, yahan tak ke wo chhut jaye, jaise us ka ghar-bar aur maal tabah ho gaya.” Aur Abdullah bin Umar use suraj safed-ujla rehte parhte the."
"62","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: “Raat ki namaz do-do rak'at joron mein hai; subah ka dar ho to ek rak'at witr parho.”"
"63","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jo hamare khilaf hathiyar uthaye, wo hum mein se nahin.”"
"64","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) bayan karte hain: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko do eenton ke darmiyan qibla-rukh ho kar hajat karte dekha, aur wo (Ibn Umar) ghar ki chhat par the. Ayyub kehte hain: Jaise unhon ne achanak (ghair-iradi) dekha ho."
"65","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur puchha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Raat ki namaz kaisi (kaise parhein)? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Do-do (rak'at); jab daro ke subah hone wali hai, to ek (rak'at) witr parho, jo tumhari (pichhli) namaz ko taaq bana degi.”"
"66","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Maine ek anguthi banwai hai aur us par 'Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)' naqsh karaya hai. Is liye koi aisi ibarat anguthi par naqsh na karaye.”"
"67","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saman ke bazaron mein utarne se pehle (raaste mein) rokne aur najash [qeemat barhane ke liye boli lagane] se mana kiya."
"68","[AI-translation] Nafi' (Rahimahullah) ne bayan kiya: Main Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke sath tha jabke wo ihram mein the. Unhon ne chadar li, to maine un par topi rakh di. Unhon ne puchha: Ye kya hai? Maine kaha: Ye topi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tu nahin janta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne (ihram wale ko) topi pehenne se mana kiya?"
"69","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Ae Allah! Hamare Makka mein, hamare Madina mein, hamare Sham mein, hamare Yaman mein, hamare sa' aur hamare mudd mein barkat de.” Ek aadmi ne kaha: “Ae Allah ke Rasul! (Iraq aur Misr ka kya?)” Unhon ne jawab diya: “Wahan se shaitan ka seeng niklega, aur wahan zalzale aur fitne hain.”"
"70","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Mere ba'd hakim honge; jo un ke jhut ki tasdeeq kare aur un ke zulm mein un ki madad kare, wo mujh se nahin aur main us se nahin, aur wo hauze kausar par mere paas na aa sakega. Aur jo un ke jhut ki tasdeeq na kare aur un ke zulm mein un ki madad na kare, to wo mujh se hai aur main us se hun, aur wo mere hauz par aayega.”"
"71","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ka'b bin Ujra (Raziyallahu anhu) ke chehre par juwein dekhein aur puchha: “Shayad tere sir ke keere tujhe takleef dete hain?” Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Nabi ne farmaya: Sir mundao aur fidya do. Unhon (Ka'b ne) kaha: Maine gaaye se fidya diya; us ka haar guntha aur nishan lagaya."
"72","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas bethe the ke ek musafir aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne betha, ghutne un ke qareeb karke. Phir puchha: Islam kya hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin aur Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Allah ke Rasul hain, paanch namazein parhna, Ramazan ke mahine mein roza rakhna, zakat ada karna aur Allah ke ghar ka hajj karna.” Us ne puchha: Agar main ye sab karun to kya main musalman hun? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Haan.” Us ne kaha: Sach farmaya. Phir puchha: Iman kya hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Allah, us ke farishton, us ki kitabon aur us ke Rasoolon par iman lana, aur aakhirat ke din, dobara uthne, hisab, jannat, jahannam aur taqdeer par iman lana.” Us ne puchha: Agar main ye karun to kya main momin hun? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Haan.” Us ne kaha: Sach farmaya. Phir puchha: Ihsan kya hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Allah ki ibadat karna jaise tu use dekhta hai, aur agar tu use na dekhe to (jaan ke) wo yaqeenan tujhe dekhta hai.” Us ne puchha: Agar main aisa karun to kya main muhsin hun? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Haan.” Phir puchha: Qiyamat (qiyamat ka din) kab aayegi? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: Us zat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, puchha gaya puchhne wale se zyada nahin janta.” Us ne puchha: Us ki nishaniyan kya hain? Unhon ne jawab diya: “Jab nange-paanv, nange log ek-dusre par fakhr karne lagein.” Us ne puchha: Beghar log? Unhon ne jawab diya: Haan. Phir musafir chala gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Us aadmi ko wapas bulao.” Hum bahar gaye aur kisi ko na dekha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muskuraye, phir farmaya: “Ye Jibrail the jo tumhein tumhara deen sikhane aaye the. Is surat mein wo pehle kabhi nahin aaye the.”"
"73","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Ae aadam ke bete! Do cheezon (jo maine tujhe dein) mein se ek bhi tere bas mein na thi. Maine jaan nikalte waqt tere maal ke hisse par tujhe ikhtiyar diya, taake us ke zariye tujhe paak karun; aur (dusri cheez) muddat khatm hone ke ba'd mere bandon ka tujh par namaz parhna.”"
"74","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Us aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai, mare hue par teen din se zyada sog manana halal nahin, siwa shauhar ke.”"
"75","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki talbiya thi: “Labbaik Allahumma labbaik, la shareek lak labbaik; innal hamd wan ni'mata lak walmulk, la shareek lak.”"
"76","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat (ki namaz) do-do rak'at joron mein hai; subah ka dar ho to ek (rak'at) parho jo pehle parhi ko taaq bana de."
"77","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki anguthi ka nageena hatheli ki taraf tha."
"78","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sone ki anguthi banwai aur teen din pehni, to sahaba-e-kiram (Raziyallahu anhum) ne bhi anguthiyan banwayein aur pehnein. Phir use utara aur chandi ki anguthi banwai aur us par 'Muhammad Rasulullah' naqsh karaya. Ye anguthi wafat tak un ke paas rahi. Phir wafat tak Abu Bakr ke paas, wafat tak Umar ke paas, chhe saal Usman ke paas rahi. Phir ek baat keh kar use ansar ke ek aadmi ko diya, to wo kunwein (Arees) mein gir gayi. Talash ki gayi par na mili, to Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne waisi hi anguthi banwai aur us par 'Muhammad Rasulullah Sallallahu alaihi wasallam' naqsh karaya."
"79","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Len-den karne wale do shakhson ko juda na hone tak ikhtiyar (bai' radd karne ka haq) hai, jab tak donon ne ikhtiyar ki shart na lagayi ho."
"80","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Munchein katarna aur zere-naf baal mundna fitrat ke kaamon mein se hain.”"
"81","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madina mein Eidul Azha ke din oont zibah karte the; oont na karte to (bakri) zibah karte the."
"82","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne masjid mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pukara aur puchha: “Muhrim kya kapre na pehne?” Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: “Muhrim qamees, pagri, topi aur pajama na pehne, na moze pehne jab tak jute na milein. Jute na milein to moze pehen sakta hai, lekin takhnon se neeche kaat le. Aur koi kapra istemal na kare jise za'fran ya wars (khushbu) laga ho.”"
"83","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Tum mein se koi qurbani ke gosht mein se teen din se zyada na khaye.” Teesre din suraj doob jata to Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) apni qurbani ke gosht mein se na khate."
"84","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Ihram wala paanch janwar maar sakta hai: chuha, kaatne wala kutta, cheel, kauwa aur bichhu.”"
"85","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko safar mein jaldi nikalna hota to maghrib ko muakhkhar karte aur maghrib-isha jama karte the. Nafi' (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bhi aisa hi kiya jabke main un ke sath tha."
"86","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Teen aadmi safar kar rahe the ke aasman ki (barish) ne unhein gher liya; pahar ki ghaar mein panah li; un par chattan giri...” Aur hadith ko taweel bayan kiya."
"87","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne fathe Makka ke din auraton aur bachon ke qatl se mana kiya."
"88","[AI-translation] Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Namaz se pehle khana sunnat hai."
"89","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jo duniya mein sharab piye, tauba na kare to aakhirat mein use na piyega.”"
"90","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar ki Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ke wo sawari par namaz parhte the; usi tarah sawari par witr bhi parhte the. Musa ne Nafi' se, Ibn Umar ke qaul ka da'wa kiya: Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sawari par witr parhte dekha."
"91","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Usama Fatima aur dusron ke siwa logon mein mujhe sab se mehboob hai.”"
"92","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannati jannat mein aur jahannami jahannam mein dakhil honge; un ke darmiyan ek pukarne wala khara hoga aur kahega: Ae jannatiyon! Maut nahin; ae jahannamiyon! Maut nahin; har shakhs jahan hai wahin hamesha rahega."
"93","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jo ghulam aaqa ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare, wo zaani hai.”"
"94","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne busr-rutab ikatthe aur busr-khajur ikatthe (nabiz banane) se mana kiya."
"95","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha gaya: “Masjid ka baayan hissa khaali ho gaya hai.” To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jo masjid ke baayein hisse ko aabad kare, us ke liye dohra sawab hai.”"
"96","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zuban thi: “A tahsab, wa yahsabun.”"
"97","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne talbiya parhi aur farmaya: “Labbaik Allahumma labbaik, labbaik la shareek lak labbaik; innal hamd wan ni'mata lak walmulk, la shareek lak.” Nafi' ne khabar di: Ibn Umar is mein barhate the: Labbaik labbaik, labbaik wa sa'daik; bhalai tere hathon mein hai; raghbat aur amal teri taraf. Nafi' ne khabar di: Ibn Umar kaale rukn aur yamani ko chhute the aur kehte the: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko in donon ko chhute dekhne ke ba'd se tangi-farakhi mein inhein nahin chhora."
